{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45408","headline":"风入松 · 皎然","name":"风入松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西岭松声落日秋，千枝万叶风飀飀。\n美人援琴弄成曲，写得松间声断续。\n声断续，清我魂，流波坏陵安足论。\n美人夜坐月明里，含少商兮点清徵。\n风何凄兮飘飘，搅寒松兮又夜起。\n夜未央，曲何长，金徽更促声泱泱。\n何人此时不得意，意苦弦悲闻客堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45408.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45408","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}